# Bulk CO2 molecular fluid, fix ilves
# Rigid CO2 TraPPE model
# [Potoff and J.I. Siepmann, Vapor-liquid equilibria of
# mixtures containing alkanes, carbon dioxide and
# nitrogen AIChE J., 47,1676-1682 (2001)].
#
# variables available on command line

variable        temp index 338.0
variable        lbox index 25.0
variable        spacing index 5.0

# global model settings

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long  14
pair_modify     mix arithmetic tail yes
kspace_style    pppm 0.00001
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic

# box, start molecules on simple cubic lattice

lattice         sc ${spacing}
lattice         sc 5.0
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5 5 5
region          box block 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 25.0 0 ${lbox} 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 25.0 0 25.0 0 ${lbox} units box
region          box block 0 25.0 0 25.0 0 25.0 units box
create_box      2 box                                       bond/types 1                                angle/types 1                               extra/bond/per/atom 2                       extra/angle/per/atom 1                      extra/special/per/atom 2
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (25 25 25)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
molecule        co2mol CO2.txt
Read molecule template co2mol:
# CO2 molecule file. TraPPE model.
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  3 atoms with max type 2
  2 bonds with max type 1
  1 angles with max type 1
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
create_atoms    0 box mol co2mol 464563 units box
Created 375 atoms
  using box units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (25 25 25)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

# CO2 TraPPE model

pair_coeff      1   1  0.053649   2.8
pair_coeff      2   2  0.156973   3.05
bond_coeff      1       0       1.16
angle_coeff     1       0       180

# masses

mass 1 12.0107
mass 2 15.9994

# MD settings

group           co2 type 1 2
375 atoms in group co2
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity        all create ${temp} 54654
velocity        all create 338.0 54654
timestep        1.0

# rigid constraints with thermostat

fix             rigid all ilves 0.00001 25 1000 t 1 2 a 1 #linearangle 165 0.0333333
fix             move  all nvt temp ${temp} ${temp} 100.0
fix             move  all nvt temp 338.0 ${temp} 100.0
fix             move  all nvt temp 338.0 338.0 100.0

thermo_style    custom step temp press pe ke
thermo          100

# minimize first to relax initial lattice overlap.
minimize 0.0 0.0 1000 10000

